From 0ded9b0e3972e2addd5d0d973db21f6891b26473 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SovereignOS Build <build@sovereignos.local>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 17:54:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sovereignos: squash credential_capture
 enable/relocate/permission/revert history

Collapses build-release 0001-0004 (enable at trunk_staging, relocate
to cp2a, mark READ_ONLY, revert to DISABLED) into the single commit
their own net effect already amounts to. No behavior change: the
resulting file is byte-identical to the pre-squash HEAD.

Duress Unlock final-closure audit (docs/devices/lynx-duress-unlock-patch-audit.md,
Step 2 in SovereignOS-foundation) found this flag's own upstream declared
default (frameworks/base's android.multiuser.aconfig, no explicit
state) already resolves to state: DISABLED, permission: READ_ONLY on
this product's cp2a release config once RELEASE_ACONFIG_FLAG_DEFAULT_PERMISSION's
real bp1a-inherited override is followed through - identical to what
this file states explicitly. Removing the override file entirely would
therefore produce the same on-device result.

Kept one explicit override anyway (owner sign-off, Duress Unlock final
closure Task 2) as defense-in-depth: an override file fails the build
loudly if a future upstream .aconfig edit ever changes this flag's own
default, where silence (no override file at all) would not. ADR-089
already closes credential_capture as permanently DISABLED for this
product; this commit only simplifies four commits of trial-and-error
history into the one state that decision actually landed on.
---
 .../credential_capture_flag_values.textproto                | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 aconfig/cp2a/android.multiuser/credential_capture_flag_values.textproto

diff --git a/aconfig/cp2a/android.multiuser/credential_capture_flag_values.textproto b/aconfig/cp2a/android.multiuser/credential_capture_flag_values.textproto
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..2af5b42d9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/aconfig/cp2a/android.multiuser/credential_capture_flag_values.textproto
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+flag_value {
+  package: "android.multiuser"
+  name: "credential_capture"
+  state: DISABLED
+  permission: READ_ONLY
+}
-- 
2.39.5

